  "title": "Stuffing for Slow Cooker",
  "description": "Sautéed celery, onion, parsley, and mushrooms are mixed with bread stuffing in a slow cooker in this recipe which saves time and oven space.",
  "authors": [
    "Wanda Galloway"
  ],
